<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Alusuisse.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Alusuisse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Alusuisse registered shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    850.00 SFR		PREMIUM	9.90 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     18.45 SFR		 GEARING	5.10 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 15.OCT.96-30.DEC.98   PAYDATE	14.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  941.00 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
